# zb.conf - list of projects for the 'zb' command.
#
# Format:  Name=path/to/dir     (one per line, '#' starts a comment)
#
# This file is gitignored and per-machine: keep the names stable across your
# computers, the paths can differ. To bootstrap a new machine:
#     zb --init      (copies this template to zb.conf)
# then edit the paths.

# Zettelkasten=/home/you/zettelkasten
# notes=/home/you/notes
# dotfiles=/home/you/dotfiles